        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: বাজি ধরা",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বাজি ধরা — bāji dhôrā — \"to bet; to place a wager\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বাজি ধরলে তুমি সব টাকা হারাবে। Bāji dhôrle tumi sôb ṭākā hārābe. If you bet, you'll lose all your money."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): তিনি ম্যাচে বাজি ধরলেন, tini mæche bāji dhôrlen."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বাজি ধরা (bāji dhôrā) joins বাজি, \"a bet\", usually traced to Persian bāzī, \"play, a game\", to ধরা, \"to hold\": to hold to a wager."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
